From 4f7e14f205a45b1833d2fe7da2f780370fa2a62b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vegetableleaf <benpecan106@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:25:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] cards: the 2026-10-19 content update (16.402.22) as a
 dated table, cards-160402017-20261019.json

The live game changed 13 client values on 2026-10-19 (device update folder, content 16.402.21 -> 16.402.22; the APK is
unchanged since 09-23): Skeletons and Evo Skeletons SummonRadius 400 -> 500, Dart Goblin 59 -> 56, Cannon Cart 83 -> 79
and Mass 3 -> 6, Minion Giant 66 -> 60, Flying Machine 67 -> 70, Skeleton Barrel death 57 -> 64 (evo 75 -> 64), the
Void's 2-4 target tier DPS 1155 -> 1200, Electro Dragon LoadTime 1400 -> 1600, Rune Giant FinishIfInstigatorDies
5000 -> 500, Hero Electro Wizard AttackStartDelay 500 -> removed (the shop global CHRONOS_MAX_FREE_VALUE also moved).

- tools/extract_cards.py: vintage 160402017-20261019 (raw pack + data/raw/cr-160402017-20261019 update folder); the
  Clones entry of a filter's Filters list (16.402.21: the Evo Electro Giant pulse's CommonAreaDamageFilterNoClones) is
  read as filter_clones and accepted by the delevel-pulse reader (unmodelled by the engine).
- data/derived/cards-160402017-20261019.json: the 10-06 table with exactly the 56 field deltas the extractor yields
  between 16.402.21 and 16.402.22 on one base (ClashBot scratchpad/gauntlet/L74/patch1019/make_table.py); every other
  field is the 10-06 table's. The 16.402.21-only changes are not in it (Evo E-Giant clone filter; Hero E-Wiz
  Forbid_Movement links and refund window, which the hero reader does not read yet).
- Not wired: the engine still loads only client15535 / client160402017_20261006 / client160402017. W19 integrates the
  new arm (card.rs, state.rs, py.rs, calibration cards.CARD_TABLE candidates, tests) -- PATCH1019.md section 5.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
